diff --git a/docs/source/whats_new.rst b/docs/source/whats_new.rst
index 33800e5b7..d82a1da86 100644
--- a/docs/source/whats_new.rst
+++ b/docs/source/whats_new.rst
@@ -100,7 +100,7 @@ Requirements
 
 Bugs
 ~~~~
-- Fix :class:`~moabb.datasets.compound_dataset.CompoundDataset` bypassing the inner dataset's NEMAR ``sourcedata/`` store when loading subjects: :meth:`~moabb.datasets.compound_dataset.CompoundDataset._get_single_subject_data` and :meth:`~moabb.datasets.compound_dataset.CompoundDataset.data_path` now prefetch, seed, and activate the inner dataset's NEMAR ``sourcedata/`` store so compound datasets wrapping NEMAR-mirrored datasets (such as :class:`moabb.datasets.Cattan2019_VR` and :class:`moabb.datasets.BI2014a` in Tutorial 5) serve from NEMAR instead of hitting upstream Zenodo (by `Bruno Aristimunha`_).
+- Fix :class:`~moabb.datasets.compound_dataset.CompoundDataset` bypassing the inner dataset's NEMAR ``sourcedata/`` store when loading subjects: :meth:`~moabb.datasets.compound_dataset.CompoundDataset._prefetch_nemar_sourcedata`, :meth:`~moabb.datasets.compound_dataset.CompoundDataset._get_single_subject_data`, and :meth:`~moabb.datasets.compound_dataset.CompoundDataset.data_path` now prefetch, seed, and activate the inner dataset's NEMAR ``sourcedata/`` store so compound datasets wrapping NEMAR-mirrored datasets (such as :class:`moabb.datasets.Cattan2019_VR` and :class:`moabb.datasets.BI2014a` in Tutorial 5) serve from NEMAR instead of hitting upstream Zenodo (:gh:`1358`, :gh:`1359` by `Bruno Aristimunha`_).
 - Second-pass paper-by-paper audit across all 206 dataset classes against their primary publications and repository records: fix channel-type mappings in :class:`moabb.datasets.BNCI2003_004` (``AA``..``AG`` set as ``eeg``, ``AH`` as ``eog``), :class:`moabb.datasets.Cattan2019_VR` (``Fp1`` kept as ``eeg``), :class:`moabb.datasets.Liu2024` (``ECG`` channel type ``ecg`` instead of ``misc``), and :class:`moabb.datasets.Huebner2017` / :class:`moabb.datasets.Huebner2018` (EOG channels ``EOGvu``/``EOGh``/``VEOG``/``HEOG`` counted in ``METADATA.acquisition.channel_types`` and ``AuxiliaryChannelsMetadata``), and enrich missing ``METADATA`` fields (demographics, hardware, references, filters, trial counts, DOIs, funding, ethics, and data URLs) across 137 dataset modules (:gh:`1350`, :gh:`1353` by `Bruno Aristimunha`_).
 - Render motor-execution datasets (:class:`moabb.datasets.Thapa2025`, :class:`moabb.datasets.Kueper2024`, :class:`moabb.datasets.NeBULA2025`, :class:`moabb.datasets.PerezBlanco2026`, :class:`moabb.datasets.Schirrmeister2017`, :class:`moabb.datasets.GuttmannFlury2025_ME`, and :class:`moabb.datasets.Wu2020`) as **Motor Execution** instead of **Motor Imagery** in the automated Stimulus Protocol timeline diagram, dataset webpage header, and metadata catalog (reported by Bhoj Raj Thapa, fixed by `Bruno Aristimunha`_).
 - Fix :class:`moabb.datasets.Kueper2024` keeping error trials (rest shorter than 5 s, marker ``S3``) and additional trials (``S27``) as movement events: only onsets followed by the end-of-correct-trial marker ``S128`` are kept, 40 per recording set. Also download the subjects a partial cache lacks instead of returning no runs: ``data_path`` checked only that the dataset folder existed, so a cache from version 1 or from the NEMAR deposit (subjects 1-8) would have loaded subjects 9-14 empty (:gh:`1333` by `Bruno Aristimunha`_).
